<title>USA: Patriot, Wyndham seek NYSE delays.</title>
<headline>Patriot, Wyndham seek NYSE delays.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patriot American Hospitality Corp said Monday that it and Wyndham Hotel Corp had asked the New York Stock Exchange to delay the start of trading in their stocks pending a news announcement.</p>
<p>A short time later, the companies announced they had agreed to merge.</p>
